# OSINTINEL environment configuration (copy to .env; never commit real secrets).
#
# Phase 1 runs fully offline and deterministically — no keys are required. The variables
# below are seams for later phases (doc 08 model routing, doc 05 adapter credentials).
# Adapter credentials are read from the environment ONLY and are never written to the
# ledger or any provenance record (doc 07 §4).

# --- LLM model-tier routing (doc 08 §1); used once LLM-backed agents are enabled ---
# OSINTINEL_MODEL_LARGE=claude-opus-4-8
# OSINTINEL_MODEL_SMALL=claude-sonnet-4-6
# OSINTINEL_MODEL_NANO=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Adapter credentials (Phase 3+, all optional, license-gated; off by default) ---
# MAPILLARY_TOKEN=
# Commercial/PII-heavy sources require an explicit authorized-use attestation (doc 07 §3).
